History
-------
myflames began as a fork of FlameGraph, which is licensed under the Common
Development and Distribution License (CDDL) 1.0. No FlameGraph code remains in
this version: its flame graph renderers (myflames/flamegraph.py and
apps/workspace/src/charts/flamegraph.ts) are original implementations written
from a functional specification. The repository's earlier history, and
myflames releases up to and including 2.3.0, remain available under CDDL 1.0.
